  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-session-port",
      "text": "Port a session in and out of DeepSeek Harness — bundle one session into a single ZIP and restore it anywhere.\n\n[中文](README_zh.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "Export a session with everything it references — the log (root + subagents), media, and the workspace files — into one archive, then import that archive on another DSH, fully restored and re-attached to its workspace."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "| Action | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| **Export** | Streams one ZIP: manifest → logs → subagents → media → referenced workspace files |\n| **Import** | Restores sessions, media, and workspace files; remaps paths; auto-attaches the session to its workspace |\n| **Repair** | Re-attaches an imported session and re-folds its title (fixes \"ungrouped\" / missing name) |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Requires Node.js ≥ 22.10 and `pnpm` (`dsh plugin` uses pnpm underneath).\n\n```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "From GitHub (default branch, or pin a tag)",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add \"github:seth-hg/dsh-session-port\"\ndsh plugin --profile web add \"github:seth-hg/dsh-session-port#v0.1.4\""
    },
    {
      "section": "From a local checkout",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /path/to/dsh-session-port\n```\n\nRestart `dsh web`. Two **Export / Import** buttons appear in the session header."
    },
    {
      "section": "From the session header",
      "text": "- **Export** — downloads `session-port-<id>.zip`.\n- **Import** — pick a `.zip`; it restores into the current session's workspace (the header cwd).\n\nImport also accepts DSH's built-in session-log export (the header `/export` download): it restores the root session, subagents, and media. That export carries no workspace files, so none are expected."
    },
    {
      "section": "From the HTTP routes (loopback-trusted)",
      "text": "```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "Export (scope=referenced by default, or workspace)",
      "text": "curl 'http://127.0.0.1:3080/wsx/session-pack?sessionId=<id>&scope=referenced' -o out.zip"
    },
    {
      "section": "Import into a workspace (path remap: old::new)",
      "text": "curl -X POST 'http://127.0.0.1:3080/wsx/session-pack/import?workspace=/path/to/workspace&remap=/old::/new' \\\n  --data-binary @out.zip"
    },
    {
      "section": "Repair an imported session (re-attach + re-fold title)",
      "text": "curl -X POST 'http://127.0.0.1:3080/wsx/session-pack/repair?sessionId=<id>'\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "HTTP API",
      "text": "| Route | Method | Purpose |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `/wsx/session-pack?sessionId=<id>&scope=referenced\\|workspace&level=0-9` | GET | Stream the ZIP archive |\n| `/wsx/session-pack/import?workspace=<dir>&remap=<old>::<new>` | POST | Restore an archive (JSON summary) |\n| `/wsx/session-pack/repair?sessionId=<id>` | POST | Re-attach + re-fold title (idempotent) |"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
